This is an isolated pack-analysis runtime call. Analyze only the evidence packs listed in this turn, refine pack-local candidates internally, and return only high-confidence repository knowledge that clears the admission bar. Precision is primary: source evidence alone does not justify a pattern.

Extract knowledge for owned `entry_paths`. `related_paths` are shared read-only evidence for callers, contracts, and dependencies; they do not transfer another focus's learning responsibility.

